{
  "id": "ebb06fd6-0b03-47d4-8875-8f4450e523dd",
  "but": "trouver des planches ; la querelle de griffes et la fuite",
  "titre": "Le terrain vague",
  "statut": "prete",
  "encarts": [
    {
      "id": "83716f15-2143-4257-874a-984aca5c7c25",
      "styles": {},
      "typeId": "03316a1c-6ecc-4528-b2af-fb7906793300",
      "contenu": {
        "type": "doc",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": [
              {
                "text": "Montrer l’",
                "type": "text"
              },
              {
                "type": "mention",
                "attrs": {
                  "id": "532cba13-f874-4d6f-9332-c70f743aee18",
                  "label": "Arbrachat",
                  "nature": "lieu"
                }
              },
              {
                "text": " et y chercher le terrain vague : hors des murs, près du petit port du château.",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "b66e80b9-daa3-4afb-a602-eec8c9c24bf5",
      "styles": {},
      "typeId": "032a1f8f-68cf-43b8-9871-eaa604c51e94",
      "contenu": {
        "type": "doc",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": [
              {
                "text": "Le terrain vague est un grand champ d’objets abandonnés : des roues, des planches, des boîtes rouillées.",
                "type": "text"
              },
              {
                "type": "hardBreak"
              },
              {
                "text": "Le ciel devient noir. Au loin, le tonnerre gronde.",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "acdfe9fb-b48c-409f-8cf9-eb9ac5dad20f",
      "styles": {},
      "typeId": "1cd6999c-83e4-41da-86af-51037488b239",
      "contenu": {
        "type": "doc",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": [
              {
                "text": "Trouver de bonnes planches et des clous : Malin, Moyenne, 2 succès. Avantage avec Observer et fouiller, ou avec l’aide de Charbon.",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "champs": {
        "sorte": "groupe",
        "qualite": "malin",
        "difficulte": "2"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "255db7c6-85a2-4ab2-ae21-1c449b6e9da9",
      "styles": {},
      "typeId": "08744da8-f883-4424-aeb1-0f8554a83833",
      "contenu": {
        "type": "doc",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "mention",
                "attrs": {
                  "id": "99a53e2f-6035-4ebd-b65d-b92f9966b87a",
                  "label": "Avantage et Désavantage",
                  "nature": "regle"
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "ff6af092-d442-43b3-ac52-654c72497660",
      "styles": {},
      "typeId": "032a1f8f-68cf-43b8-9871-eaa604c51e94",
      "contenu": {
        "type": "doc",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": [
              {
                "text": "Une ombre passe au-dessus de toi. Un cri perçant. Une grande buse plonge, les serres en avant : ",
                "type": "text"
              },
              {
                "type": "mention",
                "attrs": {
                  "id": "4c60dee4-3f6c-48c5-b9b3-a80793f2e803",
                  "label": "La buse",
                  "nature": "pnj"
                }
              },
              {
                "text": ".",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "9a7206f5-b007-4df5-9e35-959d20ce4f2d",
      "styles": {},
      "typeId": "35c92e07-bb4e-4853-9a58-9627ad3bd6f7",
      "contenu": {
        "type": "doc",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": [
              {
                "text": "La buse est une bête sauvage : elle ne parle pas. On ne discute pas avec elle.",
                "type": "text"
              },
              {
                "type": "hardBreak"
              },
              {
                "text": "Les prédateurs attaquent toujours.",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "343e756b-9ea4-4bd8-8994-5b92512a8fcf",
      "styles": {},
      "typeId": "08744da8-f883-4424-aeb1-0f8554a83833",
      "contenu": {
        "type": "doc",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "mention",
                "attrs": {
                  "id": "3cd1e6ac-f1be-4b6e-a221-5f767ba6970e",
                  "label": "La règle unique",
                  "nature": "regle"
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "83d44ace-b8cb-48ce-bbc8-9ffc41d03701",
      "styles": {},
      "typeId": "53857dd5-4db0-4e8e-983b-d55b52cfecfc",
      "contenu": {
        "type": "doc",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": [
              {
                "text": "Querelle de griffes contre ",
                "type": "text"
              },
              {
                "type": "mention",
                "attrs": {
                  "id": "4c60dee4-3f6c-48c5-b9b3-a80793f2e803",
                  "label": "La buse",
                  "nature": "pnj"
                }
              },
              {
                "text": ".",
                "type": "text"
              },
              {
                "type": "hardBreak"
              },
              {
                "type": "mention",
                "attrs": {
                  "id": "4c60dee4-3f6c-48c5-b9b3-a80793f2e803",
                  "label": "La buse",
                  "nature": "pnj"
                }
              },
              {
                "text": " : Costaud 3, Malin 2, Mignon 1, Cœur 3. Talent : Griffer.",
                "type": "text"
              },
              {
                "type": "hardBreak"
              },
              {
                "text": "Entrer dans la querelle coûte 1 Amitié. Sans Amitié, ou si la joueuse refuse : il faut fuir.",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "1ee26059-1b71-4c46-96bb-240d23fd4808",
      "styles": {},
      "typeId": "08744da8-f883-4424-aeb1-0f8554a83833",
      "contenu": {
        "type": "doc",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "mention",
                "attrs": {
                  "id": "7f746290-9388-4349-8f1f-d8e642df5b76",
                  "label": "Querelle de griffes",
                  "nature": "regle"
                }
              },
              {
                "text": " · ",
                "type": "text"
              },
              {
                "type": "mention",
                "attrs": {
                  "id": "54e10f02-b74e-4ba2-bcac-f8134d0fa843",
